OL,3,GNEWSANightclub to change ownership
OL,4,Aafter three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of a town's biggest and busiest
OL,7,Fnightclubs says new owners will take
OL,8,Fover the venue after 33 years.
OL,10,FThe Middlesbrough Empire has hosted
OL,11,Facts including Pete Tong, the Arctic
OL,12,FMonkeys and James Arthur, but it
OL,13,Fannounced the venue would close in its
OL,14,Fcurrent form on 17 November.
OL,16,FOutgoing general manager and director
OL,17,FJordan Jefferson said it would undergo
OL,18,Frefurbishment and reopen as a "venue of
OL,19,Fsome sort" but he did not know much
OL,20,Fmore.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
