OL,3,GNEWSANightclub to change ownership
OL,4,Aafter three decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the club thanked its
OL,7,Fpatrons for "the years of support, the
OL,8,Funforgettable nights, the laughter, the
OL,9,Fdancing and the memories that will stay
OL,10,Fwith us long after the lights go out".
